    "title": "Entdecken von Typen",
    "descriptionContent": "Lerne die verschiedenen Arten von Werten kennen, die wir in Variablen speichern können.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17174,
        "title": "Typen",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145363,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir haben bereits viele verschiedene Arten von Werten gesehen und verwendet. In der Programmiersprache werden diese verschiedenen Arten von Werten <strong>Typen</strong> genannt.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145364,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Strings sind Zeichen zwischen Anführungszeichen <code>\" \"</code>, wie der Wert <code>\"PlayerOne\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"42\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"30\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;PlayerOne&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerName);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"PlayerOne\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145365,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Number</strong> ist ein weiterer Typ, den wir bereits verwendet haben. Er repräsentiert numerische Werte wie <code>100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>100</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145366,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der Typ <strong>boolean</strong> enthält nur zwei Werte: die speziellen Werte <code>true</code> und <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isGameOver = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isGameOver);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>false</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145367,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wenn wir <code>false</code> in <code>isPaused</code> speichern, sagen wir, dass wir einer Variablen einen Wert <strong>zuweisen</strong>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"49\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isPaused);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>isPaused</code>, gefolgt von <code>false</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145368,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie nennt man Werte wie Booleans, Strings und Zahlen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Typen</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Variablen</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle Typen aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145369,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie erkennen wir Werte des Typs <strong>string</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Durch die Anführungszeichen <code>\" \"</code>, die sie umgeben</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Dadurch, dass es immer Wörter oder Buchstaben sind</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Durch die Anführungszeichen <code>\" \"</code>, die sie umgeben.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145370,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welcher Wert ist vom Typ <strong>number</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>100</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"100\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>100</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145371,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was sind die <strong>boolean</strong>-Werte?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code> und <code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"True\"</code> und <code>\"False\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>true</code> und <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145372,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist eine Variablenzuweisung?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Speichern eines Wertes in einer Variable</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Einer Variable einen Namen geben</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Speichern eines Wertes in einer Variable.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145373,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Weise der <code>levelName</code> Variable einen <strong>String</strong> zu, der <code>score</code> einen <strong>Number</strong>, und der <code>hasKey</code> einen <strong>Boolean</strong>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"null\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"67\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Forest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"2800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasKey = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelName, score, hasKey);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"Forest\"</code>, gefolgt von <code>2800</code> und schließlich <code>true</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145374,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Speichere einen <strong>String</strong>-Wert in die Variable <code>enemyType</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyType = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyType);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>\"Slime\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145375,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Speichere einen <strong>Zahlenwert</strong> in die Variable.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;10&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" livesLeft = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(livesLeft);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>livesLeft</code>, gefolgt von <code>3</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145376,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gib <code>isPaused</code> den <strong>boolean</strong>-Wert <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"21\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isPaused);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>true</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 145377,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Weise der <code>const</code>-Variable <code>enemyCount</code> den Wert <code>57</code> zu.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;fifty-seven&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyCount = \" /><text value=\"57\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyCount);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>const</code>, gefolgt von <code>enemyCount</code> und schließlich <code>=</code>, <code>57</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17176,
        "title": "Arbeiten mit Typen",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145379,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>+</code> ist das Zeichen zum Verbinden oder Addieren. In Spielen addieren wir oft Zahlen (wie Schaden) und verbinden auch Strings (wie UI-Text).</p><p>Beim Verbinden von zwei Werten können wir je nach ihren Typen unterschiedliche Ergebnisse erhalten.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;10&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;10&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>+</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145380,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wenn Zahlen mit Strings verbunden werden, wird die Zahl automatisch in einen String umgewandelt.</p><p>Verbinde die Werte und wirf einen Blick auf den resultierenden String für eine Spiel-UI-Nachricht.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;+&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>+</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145381,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kombiniere einen String und eine Zahl, um die Punktzahl eines Spielers anzuzeigen.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;99&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>99</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145382,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Das Hinzufügen einer Zahl zu einem String funktioniert auch, wenn wir eine Variable wie <code>score</code> verwenden, die eine Zahl speichert, anstatt eines numerischen Werts.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"result\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + score;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>score</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145383,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir können auch Strings und Booleans verknüpfen.</p><p>Kombiniere einen String und einen Boolean, um eine Spielstatus-Flagge anzuzeigen. Ist der Spieler am Leben?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"38\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Player alive: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>true</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145384,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Auch das Hinzufügen eines booleschen Werts zu einer Zeichenkette funktioniert, wenn wir eine Variable wie <code>isPaused</code> verwenden, die einen booleschen Wert speichert.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;pass&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + isPaused;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>isPaused</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145385,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welches Zeichen verwenden wir, um zwei Werte zu addieren oder zu verbinden?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>+</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>+</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145386,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welcher Typ ist das Ergebnis der Verknüpfung eines Strings mit einer Zahl?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Zeichenkette</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Zahl</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle Zeichenkette aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145387,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10 damage</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10 \"damage\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>10 damage</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145388,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?<br /></p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + level;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(label);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Level 3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>levelLevel</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Level 3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145389,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist das Ergebnis der Verknüpfung eines Strings und eines Booleans?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ein String</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ein Boolean</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ein String.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145390,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss defeated: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Boss defeated: true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Boss defeated: true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145391,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Addiere die Zahlenwerte, um die Endpunktzahl des Spielers zu erhalten.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScore = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(finalScore);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>+</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145392,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Füge einen String-Wert zum numerischen Wert hinzu und überprüfe das String-Ergebnis für ein Spiel-HUD.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot; coins&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>+</code>, gefolgt von <code>\" coins\"</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 145393,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Füge einen Zahlenwert zur Zeichenkette hinzu.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>+</code>, gefolgt von <code>2</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 145394,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
